OL,3,GNEWSATarget exceeded in quay #100k
OL,4,Afundraising drive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA race is on to fix an historic harbour
OL,7,Fbefore any winter storms cause
OL,8,Fadditional damage.
OL,10,FMore than #100,000 has been raised
OL,11,Ffollowing a community campaign to
OL,12,Fpreserve Gorran Haven Harbour Quay,
OL,13,Fnear Mevagissey in Cornwall.
OL,15,FThe Gorran Haven Harbour Trust (GHHT)
OL,16,Fsaid the 19th Century quay needed to be
OL,17,Funderpinned to prevent the end
OL,18,Fcollapsing after storm damage earlier
OL,19,Fthis year caused large cracks. Cracks
OL,20,Fhave been temporarily filled in.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
